{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 4,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Answer me when I call, God of my righteousness. my distress. Have mercy on me, and hear my prayer.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "显我为义的 神啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "顯我為義的上帝啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "You sons of men, how long shall my glory be turned into dishonor? Will you love vanity and seek after falsehood?",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们这上流人哪，你们将我的尊荣变为羞辱？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們這上流人哪，你們將我的尊榮變為羞辱？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "But know that the LORD has set apart for himself him who is godly; The LORD will hear when I call to him.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们要知道，耶和华已经分别虔诚人归他自己；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們要知道，耶和華已經分別虔誠人歸他自己；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Stand in awe, and don’t sin. your own heart on your bed, and be still.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们应当畏惧，不可犯罪；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們應當畏懼，不可犯罪；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Offer the sacrifices of righteousness. your trust in the LORD.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "当献上公义的祭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "當獻上公義的祭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "Many say, “Who will show us any good?” LORD, let the light of your face shine on us.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "有许多人说：谁能指示我们什么好处？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "有許多人說：誰能指示我們甚麼好處？",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "You have put gladness in my heart, more than when their grain and their new wine are increased.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你使我心里快乐，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你使我心裏快樂，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "In peace I will both lay myself down and sleep, for you alone, LORD, make me live in safety.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我必安然躺下睡觉，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我必安然躺下睡覺，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}